  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  portuguese: Use as teclas de 0 a 9 para movimentar a arara, fique atento as ordens numéricas de cada fase ja que nem sempre estão em ordem crescente ou decrescente.
  english: Use the keys from 0 to 9 to move the macaw, pay attention to the numerical orders of each phase as they are not always in ascending or descending order.  Zero takes the arrara to its place of origin, 'ESC' closes the game and finally 'SPACE' pauses
